    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26084" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Laus</span></b> , Laudis, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the name of several
